<section class="section cta" id="contact">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow rv" style="color: var(--yellow)">Consultation fee is fully refundable if not happy</span>
    <h2 class="rv" style="margin-top: 16px">Ring for a <em>confidential chat.</em></h2>
    <p class="rv">We'll talk through what we can do for you and give you an idea of the fees. Check out our <a href="/reviews">reviews</a> - we've built our business on referrals and happy clients.</p>
    <div class="phones">
      <a class="rv phone-btn" href="tel:07799414972"><span>Michael</span><b>07799 414972</b></a>
      <a class="rv phone-btn" href="tel:07366565000"><span>Cathy</span><b>07366 565000</b></a>
      <a class="rv phone-btn" href="tel:02890132083"><span>Office</span><b>02890 132083</b></a>
    </div>
    <p class="rv contact-alt">Or email <a href="mailto:info@taxfortaxidrivers.co.uk">info@taxfortaxidrivers.co.uk</a> &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; Find us on Facebook @Taxfortaxidrivers.co.uk</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: #fff;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta h2 {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4.6vw, 52px);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .cta h2 em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--yellow);
  }

  .cta p {
    color: #c3bdb1;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-top: 14px;
    font-size: 17px;
    max-width: 52ch;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .cta p :global(a) {
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--yellow-deep);
  }

  .cta p :global(a:hover) {
    color: var(--yellow);
  }

  .phones {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 30px;
  }

  .phone-btn {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2px;
    background: #1c1a17;
    border: 1px solid #2c2925;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 16px 30px;
    transition: transform 0.18s, border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .phone-btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    border-color: var(--yellow);
  }

  .phone-btn span {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #8f897d;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .phone-btn b {
    font-size: 22px;
    color: var(--yellow);
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .contact-alt {
    margin-top: 22px;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: #8f897d !important;
  }

  .contact-alt a {
    color: #c3bdb1;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
